#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:430
#: 8abec8cb3513455aa08cab4b152ae059
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:432
#: e2128f80e9414add9f79c01ec5b02037
msgid ""
"In the example above the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between "
"waypoints #1 and #2 a total of 3 times before flying on to waypoint #4."
msgstr "在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #1 和 #2 之间来回飞行共 3 次，然后继续飞往航点 #4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:438
#: e2088984f8414752b133743fc45f93d0
msgid "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:442
#: 3308555c83404e60a2c3b1aff89a4c95
msgid ""
"This is a location marker in the mission command sequence that can be "
"used as a \"jump to\" location for the "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` command. The tag id in "
"its parameter field can be any arbitrary number between 1 and 65535."
msgstr ""
"这是任务指令序列中的位置标记，可作为 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG>` "
"指令的「跳转目标」位置。参数字段中的标签 ID 可以是 1 到 65535 之间的任意数字。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:498
#: 793e0f27a5204b07951ef06c67e6a1e1
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP_TAG"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:502
#: 870a40eb822d4a4599e37ab32514b2ec
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` item in "
"the mission list. The jump tag command can be repeated, either a "
"specified number of times before continuing the mission, or it can be "
"repeated indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"跳转到任务列表中指定的 :ref:`MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG<MAV_CMD_JUMP_TAG>` "
"项。跳转标签指令可以重复，在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:515
#: e9739e321e844be8b04dbbafc9827765
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump_tag commands in a mission after which "
"new DO_JUMP_TAG commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条 jump_tag 指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP_TAG 指令将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:577
#: 63577a29e9e24d19aded487d35e352e4
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_JUMP_TAG command"
msgstr "DO_JUMP_TAG 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:579
#: b864731bc95e4c60a0a84b9fca8f313f
msgid ""
"In the example above, the vehicle would fly back-and-forth between "
"waypoints #3 and #4 a total of 3 times before completing the mission. "
"This is because the DO_JUMP_TAG redirects the vehicle to JUMP_TAG #565 "
"twice."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞行器将在航点 #3 和 #4 之间来回飞行共 3 次后完成任务。这是因为 DO_JUMP_TAG 将飞行器重定向到 "
"JUMP_TAG #565 两次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:582
#: 5efcda3a393c4fc5b0cccebf41af4333
msgid "Conditional commands"
msgstr "条件指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:584
#: 28394b3f60d34ab8b6c9e1464212dc13
msgid ""
"Conditional commands control the execution of \\_DO\\_ commands. For "
"example, a conditional command can prevent DO commands from executing "
"based on a time delay, until the vehicle is at a certain altitude, or at "
"a specified distance from the next target position."
msgstr "条件指令控制 \\_DO\\_ 指令的执行。例如，条件指令可以根据时间延迟、直到飞行器到达特定高度或距下一目标位置特定距离来阻止 DO 指令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:589
#: 96cedc4e20fb4e43b59bd87cd0f2e0f2
msgid ""
"A conditional command may not be complete before reaching the next "
"waypoint. In this case, any unexecuted \\_DO\\_ commands associated with "
"the last waypoint will be skipped."
msgstr "条件指令可能在到达下一个航点前尚未完成。在这种情况下，与上一个航点相关联的任何未执行的 \\_DO\\_ 指令将被跳过。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:596
#: 6b38d315535846eda13bcf887825ad5b
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DELAY"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:600
#: a25b254fc4084b7bbe27f20ac0bea921
msgid ""
"After reaching a waypoint, delay the execution of the next conditional "
"\"_DO_\" command for the specified number of seconds (e.g. "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI <mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`)."
msgstr ""
"到达航点后，将下一条条件「_DO_」指令（例如 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI "
"<mav_cmd_do_set_roi>`）的执行延迟指定秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:606
#: 13313dd270c74097982a60528edd90c0
msgid ""
"This command does not stop the vehicle. If the vehicle reaches the next "
"waypoint before the delay timer completes, the delayed \"_DO_\" commands "
"will never trigger."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器。如果飞行器在延迟计时器完成前到达下一个航点，延迟的「_DO_」指令将永远不会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:665
#: 7c56ec90f5794a59978e4a8f60fd5dab
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for CONDITION_DELAY command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DELAY 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:667
#: 20c23270c6df47669e2cfdad9b5565c7
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it "
"starts 5 seconds after the vehicle has passed Waypoint #2."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其在飞行器经过航点 #2 后 5 秒才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:674
#: dff868a077db46b3a01a92a7f831fff2
msgid "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:678
#: ed220ac3d5674e88b170c6dd7695cb2d
msgid ""
"Delays the start of the next \"``_DO_``\\ \" command until the vehicle is"
" within the specified number of meters of the next waypoint."
msgstr "延迟下一条「``_DO_``\\ 」指令的执行，直到飞行器距下一个航点在指定米数范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:683
#: 4f2ad475cae54c7085bff3a8eeece6e0
msgid "This command does not stop the vehicle: it only affects DO commands."
msgstr "此指令不会停止飞行器：它只影响 DO 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:740
#: 94a84442176740ee845f9f296e120544
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for CONDITION_DISTANCE command"
msgstr "CONDITION_DISTANCE 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:742
#: 1e839a759c6f47909081eb904a50fdfe
msgid ""
"In the example above, Command #4 (``DO_SET_ROI``) is delayed so that it "
"only starts once the vehicle is within 50m of waypoint #5."
msgstr "在上述示例中，指令 #4（``DO_SET_ROI``）被延迟，使其仅在飞行器距航点 #5 50m 范围内时才开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:752
#: 4447500714174c46baea7417671dacb2
msgid "DO commands"
msgstr "DO 指令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:754
#: 6c234b279d5042e1a99b8bfc95e9e591
msgid ""
"The \"DO\" or \"Now\" commands are executed once to perform some action. "
"All the DO commands associated with a waypoint are executed immediately."
msgstr "「DO」或「立即」指令被执行一次以执行某个动作。与航点相关的所有 DO 指令立即执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:762
#: de7c5171a6844d47994140ad64d4aae0
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_CHANGE_SPEED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:775
#: 148925b2944e4e51ac7504fdf7f1493d
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:779
#: c755f01aac794f07be47d58abf8fbec2
msgid ""
"Sets the home location either as the current location or at the location "
"specified in the command. For SITL work, altitude input here needs to be "
"with reference to absolute altitude, taking into account SRTM elevation."
msgstr "将 Home 位置设置为当前位置或指令中指定的位置。对于 SITL 工作，此处输入的高度需参考绝对高度，并考虑 SRTM 高程数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:784
#: 60d757c14d6846bcb3f3f3a2ebb4c837
msgid ""
"For Plane and Rover, if a good GPS fix cannot be obtained the location "
"specified in the command is used."
msgstr "对于 Plane 和 Rover，如果无法获取良好的 GPS 定位，则使用指令中指定的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:786
#: 17663dc027ee4bdd91fdd6a9619c85d3
msgid ""
"For Copter, the command will also try to use the current position if all "
"the location parameters are set to 0. The location information in the "
"command is only used if it is close to the EKF origin."
msgstr "对于 Copter，如果所有位置参数均设置为 0，该指令也会尝试使用当前位置。指令中的位置信息仅在其接近 EKF 原点时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:851
#: bc8f12dea52e4d0eaf961fb676651221
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_SET_HOME command"
