"be set high and then after 3 seconds, it would be toggled low again."
msgstr "在上述示例中，假设继电器初始状态为关，它将被设为高电平，然后 3 秒后再次切换为低电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:998
