#: 3c59f3c8fb3a4582879d0f01c9ef86c6
msgid ""
"Cycle a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` PWM output pin between its mid-"
"position value and a specified PWM value, for a given number of cycles "
"and with a set period."
msgstr "在给定周期和设定次数内，将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` PWM 输出引脚在其中间位置值和指定 PWM 值之间循环切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1077
#: 8eaa2b44d25c4f39a04c83b00af14d29
msgid ""
"The mid-position value is specified in the ``RCn_TRIM`` parameter for the"
" channel (``RC8_TRIM`` in the screenshot below). The default value is "
"1500.."
msgstr "中间位置值在该通道的 ``RCn_TRIM`` 参数中指定（下方截图中为 ``RC8_TRIM``）。默认值为 1500。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1135
#: 0c011428f7a243a79e17f0ca29f03e3f
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_REPEAT_SERVO command"
