msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW command"
msgstr "DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1455
#: 0d356c7bdba94d36a483568d48dd3408
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1459
#: 424a09cbf9c64ab7a11d1f18896a9ca3
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` at "
"regular distance intervals. This command is useful in :ref:`camera survey"
" missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. "
"To trigger the camera once, immediately after passing the DO command, set"
" param3 to 1."
msgstr ""
"以固定距离间隔触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。此指令在 "
":ref:`相机航拍任务 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>` 中很有用。如需在经过 DO 指令后立即触发相机一次，将 param3 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1465
#: 839d3f21f5ea41dd860fef113a982118
msgid ""
"Providing a distance of zero will stop the camera shutter from being "
"triggered."
msgstr "将距离设为零将停止相机快门的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1520
#: badb4343dd234bd5be20fbc9de98956b
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST command"
msgstr "DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1522
#: 47b5b516496042c88e2c14fb1717411b
msgid ""
"The above configuration will cause the camera shutter to trigger after "
"every 5m that the vehicle travels."
msgstr "上述配置将使相机快门在飞行器每飞行 5m 后触发一次。"

